{"title":"Help:Contents","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border:1px solid #999; background: #fff; margin: .3em .3em .3em 1em; padding: 3px; float:right\"><tbody><tr><td>\n<span id=\"shortcut\"><b>Shortcut</b>:<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:HELP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:HELP\">A:HELP</a></div>\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This is a list of all the help files on the AoPS Wiki. Some basic help can also be found at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Tutorial\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Tutorial\">AoPS Wiki tutorial</a>.\n</p><p>Please note that you must be logged in as a member of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community\">the Art of Problem Solving Community</a> to edit entries in the AoPS Wiki.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Formatting_Help\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Formatting Help</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#LaTeX/Asymptote_Help\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">LaTeX/Asymptote Help</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Help_on_Mechanics_of_the_Wiki\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Help on Mechanics of the Wiki</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Formatting_Help\">Formatting Help</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Contents&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Formatting Help\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Text_formatting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Help:Text formatting\">Help:Text formatting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Images\" title=\"Help:Images\">Help:Images</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Tables\" title=\"Help:Tables\">Help:Tables</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Math\" title=\"Help:Math\">Help:Math</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"LaTeX.2FAsymptote_Help\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"LaTeX/Asymptote_Help\">LaTeX/Asymptote Help</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Contents&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: LaTeX/Asymptote Help\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For help on these subjects, see <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX\" title=\"LaTeX\">LaTeX</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote_(Vector_Graphics_Language)\" title=\"Asymptote (Vector Graphics Language)\">Asymptote</a>, respectively. There is, however, a short tutorial on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27bb8d5acf15ea850c966cc6b82b448f35681a19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{\\LaTeX}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> in the section above.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Help_on_Mechanics_of_the_Wiki\">Help on Mechanics of the Wiki</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Contents&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Help on Mechanics of the Wiki\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Namespaces\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Help:Namespaces\">Help:Namespaces</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Template\" title=\"Help:Template\">Help:Template</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Searching\" title=\"Help:Searching\">Help:Searching</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Shortcut\" title=\"Help:Shortcut\">Help:Shortcut</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Category\" title=\"Help:Category\">Help:Category</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Variables\" title=\"Help:Variables\">Help:Variables</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Contents&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/blog/articles/how-to-write-a-solution\">How to Write a Solution</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017102348\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 318/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 183/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.409      1 Template:Shortcut\n100.00%    5.409      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1365:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017102348 and revision id 248877. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}